# Nilsson SPA

## Stack

- React 19 + Vite 8 + TypeScript (strict)
- Tailwind CSS v4 via `@tailwindcss/vite`
- Framer Motion 12 for UI motion

## Layout direction

- **Horizontal scroll experience** — design TBD; do not assume vertical section stacking
- Add design tokens/fonts only when provided by the design spec

## Structure (planned)

```
src/
  components/
  sections/
  hooks/
  lib/
```

## Conventions

- Path alias: `@/` → `src/`
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`
- Keep bundle lean; lazy-load heavy libs when needed
- No `console.log` in production code; no `any` types
